    "title": "Red Robin",
    "description": "Red Robin Gourmet Burgers, Steak Fries, Wings, Monster Milkshakes, and more are just a few taps away. With easy customization features and Red Robin Royalty\u00ae rewards, everything you love about the Yummm\u00ae expert is in the palm of your hand.\r\n\r\nThe new ordering experience makes it easy to add items, modify ingredients, and save orders for even simpler future orders. You can also view and redeem your Red Robin Royalty rewards at any point in the process.\r\n\r\nNot Red Robin Royalty? No problem. Sign up in the app and earn tasty perks like these: \r\n\r\n\u2022 Free birthday burger during your birthday month\r\n\u2022 Every 10th burger or entr\u00e9e free\r\n\u2022 $20 off your 6th visit when you visit 5 times in the first 5 weeks\r\n\u2022 Surprise rewards designed just for you\r\n\u2022 Military & Teacher rewards\r\n\r\nPick it up, go curbside, or get it delivered \u2013 everything you need to enjoy Red Robin is now available at your fingertips. \r\n\r\nRed Robin. Yummm.",
